[00:20.62]1. Many are the weaknesses
[00:26.50]That we all possess.
[00:33.04]Still Jehovah cares for us,
[00:38.36]Loves us nonetheless.
[00:46.36]He is so merciful;
[00:52.56]His love, so powerful.
[00:59.60]May we show this kind of love,
[01:05.96]Help those in distress.
[01:21.92]2. Some at times are weak in faith,
[01:28.18]Strong though they appear.
[01:34.60]By our reassuring words,
[01:40.94]We can calm their fears.
[01:47.74]Weak ones to God belong;
[01:52.68]His spirit makes them strong.
[01:59.04]May we feel their pain and cares,
[02:04.90]Help them dry their tears.
[02:23.10]3. Rather than condemn the weak,
[02:24.72]We should bear in mind
[02:24.72]How much we can strengthen them
[02:24.72]By our being kind.
[02:27.52]May we be diligent,
[02:27.62]Give them encouragement.
[02:28.00]As we lend our kind support,
[02:28.12]Comfort they will find.
